{
  "utterance": "Answering Jonas and Leila: I'll take the backup role as a tentative proposal. I'll be the person who can switch the kiosk off, but only if Jonas confirms that's technically possible without his edit. That's my commitment, not a group agreement. Leila's rule, that a contributor's request is enough to remove an excerpt, I accept as the working default, and Mara logs it. Payment I can't settle: I won't invent funds. I'll ask Mara, Jonas and Leila for labeled hour estimates, including contributor time, so we can price it against the 6,000 credits. Still undecided: payment amount and whether the listening event is offered to every contributor.", 
  "cites": ["T1"],
  "memory": "Theo: tentatively backup to switch kiosk off, pending Jonas confirming feasibility. Accepts contributor request suffices for removal, Mara logs. Will request labeled hour estimates incl. contributor time. Open: payment amount, listening event for all, budget vs 6,000 credits."
}
